OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers will continue this evening and
OL,7,Ftonight especially over the north and
OL,8,Fwest, but with some drier and clearer
OL,9,Fintervals too. Moderate to fresh
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA few light showers
OL,13,Fpossible in the morning then becoming
OL,14,Fdry and bright with some sunny
OL,15,Fintervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
