OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,7,Fquite cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,8,FSome sunshine around too. Cloudy on
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday with occasional
OL,10,Frain, perhaps brighter later Saturday.
